WEBVTT

NOTE
Interior tour of Balamb Garden, panning from the corridor floor up to the central hub.
Duration: approximately 22 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
The interior corridor of Balamb Garden — a purple carpet strip runs down the center.

00:05.000 --> 00:09.000
A cadet descends stairs as warm light spills in from outside.

00:09.000 --> 00:14.000
The Garden courtyard is lush with trees and benches as cadets walk and relax in the sunlight.

00:14.000 --> 00:22.000
Looking up at the Garden's hub, a futuristic tower spirals toward the sky, crowned by a glowing halo